# Web server and routes (D51); runs only under `otter serve`. check only.
api is a web server
    port is 5000
    host is "localhost"
.
when api receives GET at "/users"
    respond with "users" as json
.
when api receives POST at "/users" into req
    respond with "created" as json and status 201
.
when api receives a request at "/hello"
    respond with "Hello from Otter!"
.
when api receives at "/default"
    respond with "default is GET"
.
when api receives DELETE at "/health"
    respond with status 204
.
when api receives GET at "/missing"
    respond with "Not Found" as json and status 404
.
start api
